# NutriBot AI Rules (Cursor / Cross-Agent)
Always follow the project conventions defined in:
- `AGENTS.md` - Core guidelines and Jira integration (Project Key: NB)
- `CLAUDE.md` - Build & test commands, layer separation
- `API_CONTRACTS.md` - Standard JSON API response structure (`success`, `message`, `data`, `timestamp`)
- `PROJECT_TODO.md` - Master 59-task checklist with `NB-xx` task codes
- `backend/sql/Database.sql` - Database schema

Mandatory Git Commit Rules:
- 100% Vietnamese commit messages
- Format: `<type>(NB-<task_id>-<LAYER>): <Tiêu đề ngắn 50-72 ký tự tiếng Việt> [#done]`
- Add `#done` at the end of the subject line to trigger Jira Smart Commits
- Use 2-4 bullet points in the commit body
- Branch name format: `feat/NB-<task_id>-<short_name>-<member_name>`
